### Create a completed practice session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/practice-sessions
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: arco_session={{cookie}}

{
    "scaleName": "A Major",
    "tempoBpm": 96,
    "octaves": 2,
    "success": true
}

### Get practice history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/practice-sessions
Cookie: arco_session={{cookie}}

### Get one practice session
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/practice-sessions/{{sessionId}}
Cookie: arco_session={{cookie}}

### Update one practice session
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/practice-sessions/{{sessionId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: arco_session={{cookie}}


{
    "tempoBpm": 108,
    "octaves": 1,
    "success": true
}

### Delete one practice session
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/practice-sessions/{{sessionId}}
Cookie: arco_session={{cookie}}
